{
  "uid": "mereka-lms-operations-signals",
  "title": "Mereka LMS - Operations Signals",
  "description": "Canonical LMS operator board for nonprod dependency pressure, backup freshness, PVC saturation, and critical workload availability.",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "mereka-lms",
    "operations",
    "applications",
    "openedx",
    "nonprod"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "LMS Monitoring Rules",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms/blob/main/deploy/k8s/base/monitoring/prometheusrule-lms.yaml"
    },
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Velero Monitoring Rules",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms/blob/main/deploy/k8s/base/monitoring/prometheusrule-velero.yaml"
    },
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Wave 1 Design",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/Biji-Biji-Initiative/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/reports/lms-operations-signals-wave-1-design-2026-04-11.md"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Contracts and Intent",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Mereka LMS operations signals\n\nUse this board for operator-facing dependency and reliability signals that sit between the broad nonprod overview and the LMS SLO board.\n\n| Scope | Signals |\n|---|---|\n| Dependencies | MySQL connection pressure, Redis rejection/eviction pressure |\n| Reliability | Velero freshness, critical deployment availability |\n| Storage | Highest PVC utilisation in dev/staging |\n\nThis board is intentionally nonprod-only and targets `mereka-lms-dev` plus `stg-mereka-lms`."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dev MySQL Connection Utilisation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Threads connected divided by max connections for the dev MySQL service.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mysql_global_status_threads_connected{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"mysql\"} / clamp_min(mysql_global_variables_max_connections{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"mysql\"}, 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Staging MySQL Connection Utilisation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Threads connected divided by max connections for the staging MySQL service.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mysql_global_status_threads_connected{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"mysql\"} / clamp_min(mysql_global_variables_max_connections{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"mysql\"}, 1)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Velero Last Success Age",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Age of the most recent successful Velero backup across the nonprod cluster.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 43200
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 86400
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - max(velero_backup_last_successful_timestamp)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Highest LMS PVC Used %",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Highest PVC utilisation across LMS dev and staging namespaces.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(100 * (kubelet_volume_stats_used_bytes{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"} / kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"}))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "MySQL Connection Utilisation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mysql_global_status_threads_connected{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"mysql\"} / clamp_min(mysql_global_variables_max_connections{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"mysql\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "dev",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "mysql_global_status_threads_connected{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"mysql\"} / clamp_min(mysql_global_variables_max_connections{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"mysql\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "staging",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Redis Connection Pressure Events",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(redis_rejected_connections_total{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"redis\"}[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "dev rejected",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(redis_rejected_connections_total{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"redis\"}[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "staging rejected",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(redis_evicted_keys_total{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",service=\"redis\"}[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "dev evicted",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "increase(redis_evicted_keys_total{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",service=\"redis\"}[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "staging evicted",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Top LMS PVC Utilisation",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 85
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showUnfilled": false
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, 100 * (kubelet_volume_stats_used_bytes{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"} / kubelet_volume_stats_capacity_bytes{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{namespace}} / {{persistentvolumeclaim}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Critical Deployments With Unavailable Replicas",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (deployment) (kube_deployment_status_replicas_unavailable{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",deployment=~\"lms|cms|caddy|mfe|forum|discovery|credentials|notes|xqueue\"})",
          "legendFormat": "dev {{deployment}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (deployment) (kube_deployment_status_replicas_unavailable{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",deployment=~\"lms|cms|caddy|mfe|forum|discovery|credentials|notes|xqueue\"})",
          "legendFormat": "staging {{deployment}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Recent Velero Backup Failures (1h)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "increase(velero_backup_failure_total[1h])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Dev Pending Pods",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"mereka-lms-dev\",phase=\"Pending\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Staging Pending Pods",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"stg-mereka-lms\",phase=\"Pending\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CrashLooping LMS Containers",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{namespace=~\"mereka-lms-dev|stg-mereka-lms\",reason=\"CrashLoopBackOff\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
